{"data":{"body":"[P2] Stop draining new completions after the enclosing spans have ended. If `onOperationChange` arrives while this final `forceFlush()` is blocked, it can emit an operation span after its Invocation or terminal Workflow parent ended, producing invalid span boundaries. Reach completion quiescence before ending parents, then perform only a provider flush. Apply the same ordering to `InvocationOtelPlugin` and add a blocked-final-flush containment test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPenXVs77HjgH","finding_digest":"5485c6f5c7a060fb823ae9bd47d5197106c6aca5c4ebec01884e70c5887626b9","finding_id":"arf_v1_ksc4n5ohubqpxar25g6upvizoe","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::oninvocationend::late-completion-outside-invocation-boundary","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts::oninvocationend::late-completion-outside-invocation-boundary","line":414,"observation_digest":"860c6fb8c98e903e313336a05c9b9f4d931587d8f736c1beeb7128484e689c5a","observation_id":"aro_v1_qygg7ogjr2id4mjtg2qfzg47jw","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js-otel/src/execution-plugin.ts","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ksc4n5ohubqpxar25g6upvizoe","published_at":"2026-10-07T23:28:16Z","review_id":"arr_v1_fgtj7ee6zsmipyuxou77rfuolk","reviewed_base_sha":"19ee19fa0619093943f079b69943f7b5cdee7ac7","reviewed_head_sha":"014319d7c71b8818d8dcada5c036ba0029f72dac","reviewer":"codex","start_line":413,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":924},"record_id":"art_v1_owvjn2avvpzgn2mux3tj4gdqzn","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T23:28:16Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-js","id":1038735190},"schema_version":1}
